22323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xvipz","user":{"login":"PiCode9560","id":122909224,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1NyKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122909224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560","html_url":"https://github.com/PiCode9560","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PiCode9560/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T14:47:06Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T14:47:06Z","body":"`apply_force` added.\r\n\r\nThe Softbody class didn't have apply_force method, so I have to make it myself. I don't really know how force works. So I just tried stealing it from the GodotBody3D. Also, assuming that the `GodotSoftBody3D`'s `node.f` handle the forces, this is how the force is done: `node.f += p_force;`\r\nAfter testing it, the force looks kind of correct. So... good enough for now!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545822323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2547902865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100463#issuecomment-2547902865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1